<title>UK: United Assurance raises yr profit, dividend.</title>
<headline>United Assurance raises yr profit, dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		36.1		   vs 36.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 12.6		   vs 9.35</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 18.0		   vs 13.35</p>
<p> Pretax		     549.3		  vs 171.4</p>
<p>Pretax on continuing</p>
<p>    activities	    193.5		  vs 163.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The pretax profit figure for 1996 includes 371.3 million stg of exceptional items. The earnings per share figure is before exceptional items.</p>
<p>Full name of the company is United Assurance Group Plc, a company formed between a merger of Refuge Group Plc and United Friendly Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
